{"3930910": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "ENTRY_13", "steam_appid": 3930910, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4802660], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930910/extras/5e7aee573eb7eb96488d7a9e1401d128.poster.avif?t=1780266493\" width=940 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930910/extras/5e7aee573eb7eb96488d7a9e1401d128.webm?t=1780266493\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930910/extras/5e7aee573eb7eb96488d7a9e1401d128.mp4?t=1780266493\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Uncover</strong> <strong>the secrets of a shifting, procedural nightmare hidden inside a collection of mysterious VHS tapes.</strong> Document your expedience, and solve a <strong>multi-layered meta-narrative</strong>,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>SURVIVE THE RECORDINGS</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <br>You are watching unauthorized, pirated recordings of &quot;<strong>The Place</strong>&quot;, recorded directly over unassuming home and stock videos. As the tape plays, <strong>you must step into the shoes of the subjects who explored it</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Procedural Exploration:</strong> Navigate a shifting labyrinth of rooms. No two tapes are exactly alike.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Leave a Trail:</strong> Use limited emergency lights as breadcrumbs to track your way deep into the facility—because you will have to find your way back out in the pitch black.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Document Anomalies:</strong> Observe your surroundings and catalog recurring anomalies to understand the rules of this space.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Synergizing Entities:</strong> You are not alone. Entities roam the dark, actively messing with your perception and working together to hunt you down.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930910/extras/2f103c91289c7e0e17473eff29ae37e5.poster.avif?t=1780266493\" width=940 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930910/extras/2f103c91289c7e0e17473eff29ae37e5.webm?t=1780266493\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930910/extras/2f103c91289c7e0e17473eff29ae37e5.mp4?t=1780266493\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>FROM THE 90'S</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game utilizes <strong>authentic VHS visual degradation and audio distortion</strong>. <strong>Unpredictable random events can occur at any moment during the recording,</strong> ensuring the atmosphere remains thick with dread from the moment you hit &quot;Play.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930910/extras/f8f491e2bf68e3dfe523ed5433c94b6a.poster.avif?t=1780266493\" width=940 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930910/extras/f8f491e2bf68e3dfe523ed5433c94b6a.webm?t=1780266493\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>A MYSTERY BEYOND THE SCREEN</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Who recorded these tapes? Who collected this &quot;evidence&quot;? And who sold this mystery box to you? </i><br>The narrative exists in three distinct layers: the subjects in the footage, the unseen archivist, and <strong>you</strong>, the actual player sitting at your desk.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The game does not stop when you close it.</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Real-World Investigation:</strong> Mysterious folders, files, and communications will appear on your actual computer desktop, as you become an unsuspecting victim receiving something that will change their lives.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Decrypt the Truth:</strong> Search the in-game environments for passwords to unlock real encrypted archives on your PC.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Knowledge is Survival:</strong> The files you decrypt contain crucial lore and vital behavioral information about the entities that you can use to survive your next dive into the tapes.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930910/extras/521ca4556d0174831af48f88835b0918.poster.avif?t=1780266493\" width=940 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930910/extras/521ca4556d0174831af48f88835b0918.webm?t=1780266493\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930910/extras/521ca4556d0174831af48f88835b0918.mp4?t=1780266493\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedurally generated maps, hand-tuned for atmosphere</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Anomaly observation and survival gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Emergency lights as both navigation and defense</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hostile inhabitants with unique behaviors</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Layered analog horror story told through VHS tapes and files</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple endings and unlockable content</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >~60 minutes of gameplay</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930910/extras/5e7aee573eb7eb96488d7a9e1401d128.poster.avif?t=1780266493\" width=940 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930910/extras/5e7aee573eb7eb96488d7a9e1401d128.webm?t=1780266493\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930910/extras/5e7aee573eb7eb96488d7a9e1401d128.mp4?t=1780266493\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Uncover</strong> <strong>the secrets of a shifting, procedural nightmare hidden inside a collection of mysterious VHS tapes.</strong> Document your expedience, and solve a <strong>multi-layered meta-narrative</strong>,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>SURVIVE THE RECORDINGS</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <br>You are watching unauthorized, pirated recordings of &quot;<strong>The Place</strong>&quot;, recorded directly over unassuming home and stock videos. As the tape plays, <strong>you must step into the shoes of the subjects who explored it</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Procedural Exploration:</strong> Navigate a shifting labyrinth of rooms. No two tapes are exactly alike.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Leave a Trail:</strong> Use limited emergency lights as breadcrumbs to track your way deep into the facility—because you will have to find your way back out in the pitch black.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Document Anomalies:</strong> Observe your surroundings and catalog recurring anomalies to understand the rules of this space.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Synergizing Entities:</strong> You are not alone. Entities roam the dark, actively messing with your perception and working together to hunt you down.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930910/extras/2f103c91289c7e0e17473eff29ae37e5.poster.avif?t=1780266493\" width=940 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930910/extras/2f103c91289c7e0e17473eff29ae37e5.webm?t=1780266493\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930910/extras/2f103c91289c7e0e17473eff29ae37e5.mp4?t=1780266493\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>FROM THE 90'S</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game utilizes <strong>authentic VHS visual degradation and audio distortion</stro